### 创建决策（ADMIN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/decisions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "decisionType": "MANUAL_REVIEW",
  "reason": "金额较大，需要人工复核",
  "notes": "已通知风控分析师",
  "decidedBy": 1
}

### 决策列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/decisions?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 决策详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/decisions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 更新决策（ADMIN）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/decisions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decisionType": "ESCALATE",
  "reason": "升级处理",
  "notes": "转高级审核"
}
